# xcodebuild's default output location, and where it resolves Swift Package
# checkouts when run from the command line. DerivedData/ above only covers
# builds that use the default derived-data path; a plain `xcodebuild` or
# `xcodebuild -list` in this directory writes here instead, and the SPM
# checkouts alone come to over a gigabyte.
build/
